   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1   Description, profile, and\n     technologies to the run\n\n2   Architecture image: a vision\n     call writes the diagram text\n\n3   Credential: session, job,\n     client, and its own provider\n\n4   Typed text: input rails\n\n5   Third-party text: retrieved\n     rails\n\n6   Every answer: output rails\n\n7   Run lookups: CPE names to NVD,\n     sector to OTX\n\n8   Vulnerability lookup, 6 sources\n\n9   Packet capture: tshark, capture\n     text, 60,000 characters at most\n\n10 Policy inputs to policy drafting\n\n11 Workflow scan: garak, loopback\n     shim, the chosen provider\n\n12 Scan record (OWASP LLM, AVID,\n     ATLAS) saved, attached to its\n     threat model\n\n13 Workspace import; exports to\n     the browser",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "flows-list",
   "originalText": "1   Description, profile, and\n     technologies to the run\n\n2   Architecture image: a vision\n     call writes the diagram text\n\n3   Credential: session, job,\n     client, and its own provider\n\n4   Typed text: input rails\n\n5   Third-party text: retrieved\n     rails\n\n6   Every answer: output rails\n\n7   Run lookups: CPE names to NVD,\n     sector to OTX\n\n8   Vulnerability lookup, 6 sources\n\n9   Packet capture: tshark, capture\n     text, 60,000 characters at most\n\n10 Policy inputs to policy drafting\n\n11 Workflow scan: garak, loopback\n     shim, the chosen provider\n\n12 Scan record (OWASP LLM, AVID,\n     ATLAS) saved, attached to its\n     threat model\n\n13 Workspace import; exports to\n     the browser",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 16
  },
